Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0000 B0 anti-B0 B0sig  anti-B0sig     VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.0   J/psisig  gamma      SVP_HELAMP 1.0 0.0 1.0 0.0;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay J/psisig
0.5 mu+ mu-  VLL;
0.5 e+ e-   VLL;
Enddecay

End

